  "E13" [label="(22,0,0) Currently the characteristics of marginally jammed states depend on preparation protocols, with corresponding jamming points forming a jamming line."];
  "E14" [label="(14,0,0) Currently numerous studies have explored the general relationship between hyperuniformity and the jamming transition beyond maximally random jammed packings."];
  "R1" [label="(0,0,0) deduction-reasoning: Hyperuniform glasses exhibit ideal χv(q) power-law scaling with α = 4 and are categorized as class I hyperuniformity."];
